<title>FINLAND: Valmet,Rautaruukki set steel j/v.</title>
<headline>Valmet,Rautaruukki set steel j/v.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Valmet Oy said in a statement on Thursday it will set up a steel processing joint venture, PreSteel Oy, with Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy.</p>
<p>Rautaruukki will own 55 percent and Valmet 45 percent of the new company, Valmet said.</p>
